flowchart LR
    A[Android game] -->|GET /roll?backend=aer or ibm| B[Quantum dice service]
    B --> C{Backend requested}
    C -->|aer| D[Qiskit Aer]
    C -->|ibm| E[IBM Quantum least-busy backend]
    E -->|timeout or failure| D
    D --> F[hadamard-6q circuit]
    E --> F
    F --> G[Batch measurements]
    G --> H[Split into 3-bit dice groups]
    H --> I{All dice in 1..6?}
    I -->|yes| J[Return dice, backend, shots, fallback]
    I -->|no| G
    J --> K[observeDice forced roll]
